  "g7_drones": {
   "_doc": "PROVISIONAL. Heights in metres, distances in tiles (m_per_tile). steer_every: the HUD sends drone_steer at most every N ticks and on any input change. view = view_base + h * view_per_m tiles (marks enemies for the side's intel every mark_every ticks for mark_ticks). spot_mult = spot_base + h / height_max (higher sees more and is easier to spot; read by AA through DronePilot.spot_mult). Bombs fall t = sqrt(2h/g), carried by the drone's velocity, drift = rng (-1..1) x drift_per_100m x h/100 per axis. Link: quality = 1 - noise; noise = noise_base + noise_range x (d/link_range)^2 + jam_noise (EW-jammed, or within jam_margin tiles of an enemy jam field); d > link_range or an enemy jam field = LINK LOST.",
   "max_per_side": 4,
   "height_min": 8.0,
   "height_max": 120.0,
   "height_start": 40.0,
